  "project_description": "A simple WYSIWYG editor for plain text fields, providing basic formatting buttons: bold, italic, underline, strikethrough, superscript, and subscript.\n\n Features \n \n Provides the form field widget with WYSIWYG editor for plain text fields ( string , string_long ) \n Provides the field output formatted, which renders the plain text field value with allowed HTML tags. \n Per-field configuration of visible buttons and allowed HTML tags. \n Uses the contenteditable attribute to edit, so no heavy JS editors will slow up the page load time. \n \n Supporting this Module \n You can convey gratitude to me for the development of the module and motivate me to do more through these services:\n\n \n\n Back to top",
